---
source: crates/spela/tests/cli.rs
expression: run.stdout()
---
Manage DLSS, XeSS and FSR DLLs: list, update, install, restore

Usage: spela dll [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list           List a game's DLLs, or every game with DLSS, XeSS or FSR
  check-updates  Check for newer DLL versions
  update         Update a game's DLLs, or every game's, to the latest version
  install        Install a DLL into a game, any version
  cache          List the DLL versions in the DLL cache
  restore        Put a game's original DLLs back and remove the ones spela added
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json
          Print results as JSON (schema version 1)

      --demo
          Run on built-in fictional data. Your files are never written

      --log-level <LEVEL>
          Log level. Overrides SPELA_LOG
          
          [possible values: off, error, warn, info, debug, trace]

  -h, --help
          Print help
